{"4398550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LONG PIECE!", "steam_appid": 4398550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>注：游戏中所有登场角色均已成年，所涉及人物、故事、场所、情节、世界等表现形式皆为虚构，和现实中任何人物、事件均无任何关联，若有与现实元素雷同或不符的情况，皆为娱乐所需，切勿当真！</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/ed5bbca1aa1b4315f4130205fe7468d1.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有财富、名声、势力，拥有城市里所有化粪池的流浪王，掏粪工shi皇，他在临终前的一句话，让人们趋之若鹜奔向桥洞……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>『想要我的宝藏吗？想要的话可以全部给你！去找吧！我把所有宝物都放在那里了！』</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>剧情简介/STORY：</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >长期在L市独自漂泊的流浪汉刘浪，机缘巧合下邂逅了流浪女孩璐边，与此同时，神秘的打工少女茜钱也频频出现，多次对刘浪施以援手……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >开启一场始于流浪的恋爱之旅！是跟调皮不着调的野性女孩一起浪迹天涯，还是接受温柔美少女的好意重新回归正常生活？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >抑或是……登上所有流浪汉的顶点，夺取传说中的大秘宝——浪 PIECE！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色介绍/CHARACTER:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/dcc71162b4ad9c61d198cf660ae1c363.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=666 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/7076c8cc1af797a8731d332a7f7a63eb.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/f10c80f293ea919a152eb321820a4e19.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>游戏信息/INFORMATION:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总字数：约30万字</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >立绘：每位女主角各有3套立绘，共6套立绘</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG数：基础CG20枚（未算入差分和SD CG）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可攻略角色：2人 （2女主结局、1基友结局、1BE）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色语音：仅女主角有语音</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >系统：游戏含内置地图，玩家在进线前每天可于不同时间段选择前往任意一处发生事件的地点，选中对应地点即可获得对应线路的好感度，最终线路由好感度数值决定</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>STAFF：</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >企划：午休社/Noon Time Rest Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧本：好钢、晓卡</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原画：艾斯弗鲁特vita、叶叶</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >配音：艾斯弗鲁特vita、姜不空</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >音乐：椰林</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI：小彤、艾斯弗鲁特vita、叶叶</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序：晓卡、好钢</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>公共素材：</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM：DOVA-SYNDROME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >背景：みにくる、みんちりえ</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>注：游戏中所有登场角色均已成年，所涉及人物、故事、场所、情节、世界等表现形式皆为虚构，和现实中任何人物、事件均无任何关联，若有与现实元素雷同或不符的情况，皆为娱乐所需，切勿当真！</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/ed5bbca1aa1b4315f4130205fe7468d1.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拥有财富、名声、势力，拥有城市里所有化粪池的流浪王，掏粪工shi皇，他在临终前的一句话，让人们趋之若鹜奔向桥洞……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>『想要我的宝藏吗？想要的话可以全部给你！去找吧！我把所有宝物都放在那里了！』</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>剧情简介/STORY：</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >长期在L市独自漂泊的流浪汉刘浪，机缘巧合下邂逅了流浪女孩璐边，与此同时，神秘的打工少女茜钱也频频出现，多次对刘浪施以援手……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >开启一场始于流浪的恋爱之旅！是跟调皮不着调的野性女孩一起浪迹天涯，还是接受温柔美少女的好意重新回归正常生活？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >抑或是……登上所有流浪汉的顶点，夺取传说中的大秘宝——浪 PIECE！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色介绍/CHARACTER:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/dcc71162b4ad9c61d198cf660ae1c363.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=666 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/7076c8cc1af797a8731d332a7f7a63eb.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398550/extras/f10c80f293ea919a152eb321820a4e19.avif?t=1772514127\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>游戏信息/INFORMATION:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总字数：约30万字</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >立绘：每位女主角各有3套立绘，共6套立绘</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG数：基础CG20枚（未算入差分和SD CG）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可攻略角色：2人 （2女主结局、1基友结局、1BE）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色语音：仅女主角有语音</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >系统：游戏含内置地图，玩家在进线前每天可于不同时间段选择前往任意一处发生事件的地点，选中对应地点即可获得对应线路的好感度，最终线路由好感度数值决定</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra